    "type": "game",
    "name": "ZDSS: Zombie Drone Survival Show",
    "steam_appid": 2842970,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the spotlight, survive the swarm, and become the last star standing. Can you satisfy the bloodthirsty audience and stage a massacre worthy of prime-time ratings?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842970/extras/d60d231331ef1213f503d19d9a809c7d.poster.avif?t=1755251221\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842970/extras/d60d231331ef1213f503d19d9a809c7d.webm?t=1755251221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842970/extras/d60d231331ef1213f503d19d9a809c7d.mp4?t=1755251221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the not-so-distant future, humanity has mastered the art of cloning \u2014 only to use it for one thing: turning clones into zombies for a blood-soaked TV survival show. Your goal? Survive as long as possible with the help of combat drones, deadly traps, and an insatiable thirst for ratings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong>  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Top-Down Action</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Think fast or die faster. Outsmart cloned zombie swarms with brutal traps, tactical movement, and your deadly drone army.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drones of Destruction</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash a deadly squad of combat drones \u2014 from laser-cutters and electro-shockers to bombers and toxin-sprayers \u2014 with even more waiting in your arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade, combine, and deploy them for maximum destruction and efficiency.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Arena - Your Rules\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place traps and shape the battlefield to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each arena is procedurally generated \u2014 no two runs are ever the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Traps &amp; upgrades</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crush, burn, impale, and obliterate the undead in wild and creative ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more chaos you unleash, the higher your ratings soar.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Zombiminator</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the show as your chosen Zombiminator \u2014 each with unique abilities and progression paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark satire &amp; bloody style</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vicious parody of reality TV where every kill boosts your ratings and every death is part of the show.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the spotlight, survive the swarm, and become the last star standing. Can you satisfy the bloodthirsty audience and stage a massacre worthy of prime-time ratings?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842970/extras/d60d231331ef1213f503d19d9a809c7d.poster.avif?t=1755251221\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842970/extras/d60d231331ef1213f503d19d9a809c7d.webm?t=1755251221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842970/extras/d60d231331ef1213f503d19d9a809c7d.mp4?t=1755251221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the not-so-distant future, humanity has mastered the art of cloning \u2014 only to use it for one thing: turning clones into zombies for a blood-soaked TV survival show. Your goal? Survive as long as possible with the help of combat drones, deadly traps, and an insatiable thirst for ratings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong>  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Top-Down Action</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Think fast or die faster. Outsmart cloned zombie swarms with brutal traps, tactical movement, and your deadly drone army.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drones of Destruction</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash a deadly squad of combat drones \u2014 from laser-cutters and electro-shockers to bombers and toxin-sprayers \u2014 with even more waiting in your arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade, combine, and deploy them for maximum destruction and efficiency.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Arena - Your Rules\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place traps and shape the battlefield to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each arena is procedurally generated \u2014 no two runs are ever the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Traps &amp; upgrades</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crush, burn, impale, and obliterate the undead in wild and creative ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more chaos you unleash, the higher your ratings soar.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Zombiminator</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the show as your chosen Zombiminator \u2014 each with unique abilities and progression paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark satire &amp; bloody style</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vicious parody of reality TV where every kill boosts your ratings and every death is part of the show.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Welcome to the bloodiest show of the future! In this explosive rogue-lite arena shooter, you survive endless waves of cloned zombies with the help of deadly combat drones. Deploy traps, upgrade your arsenal, and turn the arena into a brutal spectacle!",
